ready: 1
kind: journey
id: health.check
display_id: FLOW-HEALTH-CHECK
module: health
actors: [actor.agent, actor.owner]
title: Check memory health
summary: The agent or owner reads the anxiety score and its recommended actions, runs the doctor when something looks wrong, and follows the named fix.
trigger: The agent starts or finishes significant work, or the owner wants to know whether memory is healthy
steps:
  - health.check.anxiety
  - health.check.act
  - health.check.doctor
  - health.check.fix
  - health.check.healthy
sequences:
  - health.seq.anxiety
  - health.seq.doctor
